<title>USA: Northern Trust issues $100 mln bank notes.</title>
<headline>Northern Trust issues $100 mln bank notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Wednesday,  according to lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER NORTHERN TRUST CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.30 PCT     MATURITY 09/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE BNK NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.898    PAY DATE 03/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A2	SPREAD 50 BP	  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    YIELD 7.315 PCT     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>INDUSTRY BANKING</p>
</text>
